cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FairLMs: fairness definitions and bias metrics for language models"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Larionov
    given-names: Michael
repository-code: "https://github.com/michaellarionov/FairLMs"
url: "https://michaellarionov.github.io/FairLMs/"
abstract: >-
  FairLMs provides 33 published bias and fairness metrics for encoder-only,
  decoder-only and encoder-decoder language models behind a single
  scikit-learn-style interface, together with a dataset-first diagnostics layer
  that reports the applicability of a measurement as a first-class outcome
  rather than collapsing missing evidence into a score of zero.
keywords:
  - fairness
  - bias
  - large-language-models
  - nlp
  - evaluation
  - metrics
  - responsible-ai
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
